<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S6.F12.sf1.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">(a)</span> </span><span id="S6.F12.sf1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">PTR-based deployment categorization.</span></figcaption>
</figure></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2">
<figure id="S6.F12.sf2" class="ltx_figure ltx_figure_panel ltx_align_center"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2609.07115v1/fig_survival_x_ptr.svg" id="S6.F12.sf2.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/269;" width="476" height="269"></object>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S6.F12.sf2.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">(b)</span> </span><span id="S6.F12.sf2.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Deployment-type composition by IP survival bucket.</span></figcaption>
</figure></div></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S6.F12.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 12</span>. </span><span id="S6.F12.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">PTR-based operational context.<span id="S6.F12.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">
(a) PTR availability and heuristic PTR-present deployment categories for 152,137 cumulative IPs.
Saturated bars show shares within the PTR-present subset; pale bars show shares among all IPs.
