<div id="A4.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.I1.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">Below-cutoff population is the percentage of version observations below the fix threshold across all 362 observed days.</span></p>
